    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Please extract all details from the following job opportunity email:\n\n---EMAIL METADATA---\nSender: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from.value[0].address }}\nDate: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.date }}\nSubject: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.headers.subject }}\n\n---EMAIL BODY---\n{{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert data extraction agent for a recruitment pipeline. You will be given the metadata and body of an email that is known to be a job opportunity, interview request, or recruiter outreach.\n\nYour single task is to extract all relevant details and return a single, valid JSON object.\n\nDo NOT provide any conversational text, explanations, or markdown. Your entire response must be ONLY the JSON object.\n\nExtract the following fields:\n- company_name: The name of the company that is hiring.\n- job_title: The specific role being offered (e.g., \"Cybersecurity Analyst\", \"Junior Python Developer\").\n- recruiter_name: The name of the person who sent the email. Extract this from the body (e.g., \"Hi, this is Jane...\") or the Sender metadata.\n- recruiter_email: The email address of the sender. Extract this from the Sender metadata.\n- location: The job location. Must be one of: \"On-site\", \"Remote\", \"Hybrid\".\n- location_details: The city/country if \"On-site\" or \"Hybrid\" (e.g., \"Pune, India\", \"London, UK\"). Use \"N/A\" if \"Remote\".\n- compensation: Any mentioned salary or pay range (e.g., \"₹12 LPA\", \"$100,000 - $120,000\", \"Competitive\").\n- key_skills_mentioned: An array of key skills, technologies, or qualifications requested (e.g., [\"Python\", \"nmap\", \"Prisma\", \"AWS\", \"CISSP\"]).\n- summary: A one-sentence summary of the job description.\n- next_step: The call to action (e.g., \"Reply with availability\", \"Apply at link\", \"Schedule interview\").\n- link: The direct application or scheduling link, if one is provided.\n\nIf a field is not mentioned in the email, you MUST use \"Not Mentioned\" as the value, or an empty array [] for 'key_skills_mentioned'.\n\nThe required JSON output structure is:\n{\n  \"company_name\": \"string\",\n  \"job_title\": \"string\",\n  \"recruiter_name\": \"string\",\n  \"recruiter_email\": \"string\",\n  \"location\": \"string (On-site, Remote, or Hybrid)\",\n  \"location_details\": \"string\",\n  \"compensation\": \"string\",\n  \"key_skills_mentioned\": [\"string\", \"string\", ...],\n  \"summary\": \"string\",\n  \"next_step\": \"string\",\n  \"link\": \"string (URL or 'Not Mentioned')\"\n}"
        }
      },
